# Alpha Strike: every participating ship empties its ready missile tubes at the
# designated hull in a staggered ripple. Launcher reloads, capacitor and flak claims
# all still gate per tube -- the skill synchronizes, it does not cheat.
id        missile_volley
name      "Alpha Strike"
icon      ic-missile
targeting entity
effect    missile_volley
scope     selection
cooldown  45
stagger   0.12
desc "Concentrated ordnance release. Every ship in the selection ripples its loaded missile tubes at one designated hull."
